<title>USA: Watson Pharmaceutical drug gets FDA nod.</title>
<headline>Watson Pharmaceutical drug gets FDA nod.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watson Pharmaceutical Inc said its Oclassen Pharmaceuticals unit received U.S. Food and Drug Administration approval to market Condylox Gel 0.5 percent for the treatment of external genital and perianal warts.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to launch the product in the second quarter of fiscal 1997.</p>
</text>
